# Nonlinear DEMO operator -- exists only to exercise symbolic differentiation on
# a genuinely nonlinear flux (quadratic in deriv and dt1). NOT a physical
# operator; it is the unit test that proves d flux / d x + the JVP emission are
# correct, checked numerically by finite differences (tests/validate_jvp.py).
operator nldemo {
    element = hex
    form    = diffusion
    flux    = g2*deriv*deriv + g1*dt1*dt1 + g0*dt2
}
